OL,3,GNEWSAFour injured with one critical in
OL,4,ABromley stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven arrests have been made after a
OL,7,Fmultiple stabbing in south-east London,
OL,8,Faccording to the Metropolitan Police.
OL,10,FFour men were taken to hospital where
OL,11,Fone remains in a critical condition.
OL,13,FParamedics and the London Air Ambulance
OL,14,Fwere called to Bromley High Street at
OL,15,Fabout 14:20 BST on Thursday.
OL,17,FPhotos posted on X appeared to show
OL,18,Fpart of Bromley High Street cordoned
OL,19,Foff by police, with emergency vehicles
OL,20,Fin attendance.
